  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solidarity grant to MECC - contribution towards core costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Middle East Council of Churches (MECC) is an ecumenical fellowship formed of four families of Churches endeavouring to work together to fulfil their common mission and foster Christian unity. MECC seeks to 
develop and support ecumenical and interfaith dialogue, and the pursuit of justice and defence of human rights in the interests of freedom, peace, and equality. CAFOD has a long-standing partnership with MECC and this solidarity grant will contribute towards MECC&apos;s core costs to ensure they have the resources to continue their essential work.</narrative>
  </description>
